# Focus Tiger · Cloudflare Worker env template (local wrangler only)
#
# Do NOT put production Secret Keys in the Vite client (.env*).
# Worker secrets: `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>` (or CF dashboard).
# GitHub Actions: repo Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions
#   (only when a workflow actually references secrets.<NAME>).
#
# Buy Yin a Tea · Tip Jar secrets (put via wrangler; never commit values):
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
#
# Non-secret vars live in wrangler.jsonc `vars` (or Dashboard):
# STRIPE_PRICE_ID=price_...   # Dashboard one-time Price = USD $9.99
# CHECKOUT_SUCCESS_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5173/?product=1&supporter=1
# CHECKOUT_CANCEL_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5173/?product=1&supporter=cancel
# ALLOWED_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:5173
#
# Example future names (do not invent values here):
# CLOUD_API_SIGNING_KEY=
# RATE_LIMIT_KV=
